{"version":1,"content":"<p>《財閥家的小兒子》鄭大胤執導、改編同名網漫的韓劇《姐姐，今生我是王妃》日前傳出《正年》金泰梨將任女主角，今天（27日）韓媒再爆料，指《臥底洪小姐》曹瀚結與《殺手媽咪》無真星亦將演出該劇，與金泰梨大談感情戲。</p><p>新劇預計明年開拍。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:20:55.670272+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:47:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.956755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:18:15.791660+00:00","content_hash":"6e11416d5ab7de218e25c8dcd50297e78ee69e5cad5321df4fae291f583a962d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}